  "worked_solution": "The expression $-\\frac{1}{5}s+2t$ has two terms: $-\\frac{1}{5}s$ and $2t.$ \n\nThe order in which we combine the terms doesn't matter. Therefore, we can also write this expression as \n\n$$\n2t-\\frac{1}{5}s.\n$$",
